nd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 For example, if the vehicle has a heavy\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 rear anti-sway\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 bar with stiff rear shocks, and no front anti-sway\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 bar with soft front springs and shocks, only\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 25% of\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 the vehicle's roll stiffness may\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 be from the front suspension.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 This particular set-up is good for "planting" both rear tires on the ground for good traction with a rear wheel drive car.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb13\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li806\ri437\sl249\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Assume the Frt Roll Stfns, % is 75% (typical of most production cars) unless special modifications have been done to the suspension for drag racing.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Then reduce it to\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 a value of\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 25-50%.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 For front wheel drive cars, certain assumptions have been made about the suspension, and this value is disabled.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb68\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s8\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li806\ri8554\sl422\slmult1\f1\fs28\b0\expnd-1\expndtw-4\charscalex100 Aerodynamics Type\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li806\sl249\slmult1\sb4\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Click on down arrow\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 button to\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 pick a general description of\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 car's aerodynamics, or choose\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 'Use\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 Specs Below' to\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 enable\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 the aerodynamics specs.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Then you can type in your own numbers to the specs below.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb17\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par
