d not been within acceptable limits, the program will display the limits.)\expnd14\expndtw72  \expnd0\expndtw0 Then\expnd3\expndtw16  \expnd0\expndtw0 click on\expnd3\expndtw16  \expnd0\expndtw0 OK (back) to return\expnd3\expndtw16  \expnd0\expndtw0 to the Main\expnd3\expndtw16  \expnd0\expndtw0 Menu.\expnd15\expndtw75  \expnd0\expndtw0 There you can\expnd3\expndtw16  \expnd0\expndtw0 click on\par\sect\sectd\sbkpage\headery731\footery748\margtsxn1120\margbsxn940\cols2\colno1\colw5664\colsr398\colno2\colw5458
